---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';import {calendars,url,seasons,terms} from '../../data/site';
export function getStaticPaths(){return calendars.map(calendar=>({params:{year:String(calendar.year)},props:{calendar}}));}
const {calendar}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`${calendar.year}年二十四节气时间表：日期和开始时间 · 知时节`} description={`${calendar.year}年完整24节气日期和开始时间，中国标准时间UTC+8，按春夏秋冬分组并附节气含义入口。`} breadcrumbs={[{name:'岁时日历',path:'seasonal-calendar/'},{name:`${calendar.year}年`,path:`seasonal-calendar/${calendar.year}/`}]}><section class="page-hero wrap"><div class="kicker">THE YEAR IN TWENTY-FOUR MOMENTS</div><h1>{calendar.year}<span> 岁时日历。</span></h1><p>每一次交节，都是下一段风景的开始。<br/>中国标准时间 UTC+8 · 四舍五入至分钟</p><div class="hero-actions">{calendars.map(c=><a class:list={['button',c.year===calendar.year?'primary':'secondary']} href={url(`seasonal-calendar/${c.year}/`)} aria-current={c.year===calendar.year?'page':undefined}>{c.year} 年</a>)}<button class="button secondary" id="print-calendar">打印日历 ↓</button></div></section><section class="wrap section calendar-section">{seasons.map(s=><div class="calendar-group"><div class="calendar-heading"><span>{s.symbol}</span><h2>{s.name}<small>{s.en}</small></h2></div><table><caption class="sr-only">{calendar.year}年{s.name}季节气时间</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">节气</th><th scope="col">日期</th><th scope="col">开始时间（北京时间）</th></tr></thead><tbody>{calendar.terms.filter(t=>terms.find(e=>e.frontmatter.slug===t.slug).frontmatter.season===s.id).map(t=><tr><th scope="row"><a href={url(`solar-terms/${t.slug}/`)}>{t.name} <span>↗</span></a></th><td>{t.displayTime.slice(0,10).replaceAll('-',' / ')}</td><td><time datetime={t.datetime}>{t.displayTime.slice(11)}</time></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>)}<div class="explain"><h2>如何阅读这张日历</h2><p>本页按传统四季分组，每组内按公历日期排列。小寒、大寒在公历年初，但在节气循环中属冬季末尾，因此冬季表格会跨越节气循环的首尾。</p><p>交节时刻采用知时节的历法计算结果。{calendar.year === 2026 && <>可对照<a href="https://pmo.cas.cn/xwdt2019/kpdt2019/202203/P020251230620718707826.pdf">紫金山天文台 2026 年日历资料</a>。</>}</p></div><CTA campaign="seasonal_calendar"/></section><script>document.getElementById('print-calendar')?.addEventListener('click',()=>window.print());</script></Base>
